   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.1em;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I am familiarising myself with the literature on Fixed Effect Models. I wondered if anyone had any references or could confirm that fixed effect models can be used in a latent variable framework.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.1em;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I have a straightforward model with approximately 2000 individuals nested in 8 groups. I am primarily interested in the individual-level relationships. The number of clusters needs to be bigger for a hierarchical model.</p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.1em;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I have created the following syntax with lavaan, in R. Assuming x = predictor, y = dv, m1 = variable, m2 = variable, cov = individual-level covariates and group = group dummies(All continuous, except some of the covariates and of course the group dummies)</p><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">model <span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">&#39; </span></span></span><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"> #latent variable </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">x =~ x_a + x_b + x_c </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">m1 =~ m1_a + m1_b + m1_c + m1_d </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">m2 =~ m2_a + m2_b + m2_c </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">y =~ y_a + y_b + y_c </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"> #structural model </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><br></span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">m1 ~  x + cov_ind1 + cov_ind2 + cov_ind3 + cov_ind4 + group1 + group2 + group3 + group4 + group5 + group6 + group7 </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">m2 ~  x + cov_ind1 + cov_ind2 + cov_ind3 + cov_ind4 + group1 + group2 + group3 + group4 + group5 + group6 + group7 </span></span></span></div><div><span style=\"margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;margin-left:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;width:auto;max-height:600px;overflow:auto;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\"><span style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-style:inherit;font-variant-caps:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:inherit;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:13px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit\">y ~ x + m1 + m2 + cov_ind1 + cov_ind2 + cov_ind3 + cov_ind4 + group1 + group2 + group3 + group4 + group5 + group6 + group7\r\n\r\n#covariance\r\nm1  ~~  m2\r\n\r\n&#39;</span>\r\n\r\n</span></span><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,&quot;Segoe UI Adjusted&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Liberation Sans&quot;,sans-serif;font-size-adjust:inherit;font-kerning:inherit;font-variant-alternates:inherit;font-variant-ligatures:inherit;font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-feature-settings:inherit;font-size:15px;vertical-align:baseline;box-sizing:inherit;clear:both;color:rgb(12,13,14)\">I&#39;d be glad for any comment on whether this looks correct or any suggestion for references.</p></div>"
